            "review_title": "Review at Ốc Phú Quốc",
            "review_text": "Rob Nesbit\nWarsaw, Poland6919 contributions\n0\nMr Ratty\nApr 2022\nStreet restaurant with plastic chairs and tables, next to train tracks and dump.....\nWas very busy, but service was quick and friendly\nOrdered a few sea food dishes and fish............ for me the fish was very delicious.\nAnd a few beers\nWas enjoyable enough, but my western sensibilities got the better of me, as right beside us were a good few rats........ha....something I am not used to seeing as I dine.....but heh maybe this is the Vietnamese way and who am I to argue?\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten June 5, 2022",
